BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.13 0.15 rg 48 280.5 Td (Follow this order so a failure is easier to isolate.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 0.12 0.13 0.15 rg 48 263 Td (A. Login and connectivity) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.13 0.15 rg 48 246 Td (1. Open the website and sign in as an admin. Confirm the dashboard loads without an error.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.13 0.15 rg 48 234.5 Td (2. Sign in separately as a member and confirm their profile or membership loads.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.13 0.15 rg 48 223 Td (3. If something fails, open browser Developer Tools \(F12\), then inspect Console and Network.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.13 0.15 rg 48 211.5 Td (Record the exact failed request and error.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 0.12 0.13 0.15 rg 48 194 Td (B. New registration and approval) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.13 0.15 rg 48 177 Td (1. Submit a registration using a unique test email.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.13 0.15 rg 48 165.5 Td (2. Confirm the site reports that the application was submitted.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.13 0.15 rg 48 154 Td (3. Run the recent applications query. Confirm a registration row is pending.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.13 0.15 rg 48 142.5 Td (4. In the admin dashboard, confirm it appears under Pending Applications. If practical, check) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.13 0.15 rg 48 131 Td (whether another already-open admin tab updates without refresh.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.13 0.15 rg 48 119.5 Td (5. Approve it. Confirm the application status changes and a member record is created.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 0.12 0.13 0.15 rg 48 102 Td (C. Membership renewal) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.13 0.15 rg 48 85 Td (1. Use a member whose expiry date is within the allowed five-day renewal window.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.12 0.13 0.15 rg 48 73.5 Td (2. Submit a renewal request from that member account.) Tj ET
